{
    "version": "2024.04.29",
    "description": "一个 yt-dlp 插件，用于解锁基于 chromium 的浏览器的 cookie 数据库。",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/seproDev/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock",
    "license": "MIT",
    "url": "https://github.com/seproDev/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock/releases/download/v2024.04.29/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock.zip",
    "hash": "sha256:3AD12DDC69B10B411287990FB3D4541417C2B3EFA7C72511F06F84E4C36DCFF3",
    "installer": {
        "script": [
            "$pluginRoot = \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.config\\yt-dlp\\plugins\\yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock\"",
            "New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \"$pluginRoot\" | Out-Null",
            "Copy-Item \"$dir\\*\" \"$pluginRoot\" -Recurse -Force",
            "",
            "$configDir = \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.config\\yt-dlp\"",
            "$configFile = \"$configDir\\config\"",
            "New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \"$configDir\" | Out-Null",
            "$configContent = \"--impersonate chrome`n--cookies-from-browser chrome\"",
            "Set-Content -Path \"$configFile\" -Value $configContent -Encoding UTF8 -Force",
            "",
            "$altConfig1 = \"$env:USERPROFILE\\yt-dlp.conf\"",
            "$altConfig2 = \"$env:APPDATA\\yt-dlp\\config\"",
            "if (Test-Path $altConfig1) { Write-Host \"WARNING: Existing config found at $altConfig1 (will be ignored)\" -ForegroundColor Red }",
            "if (Test-Path $altConfig2) { Write-Host \"WARNING: Existing config found at $altConfig2 (will be ignored)\" -ForegroundColor Red }"
        ]
    },
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": [
            "Remove-Item \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.config\\yt-dlp\\plugins\\yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
            "Remove-Item \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.config\\yt-dlp\\config\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
        ]
    },
    "notes": [
        "本清单会自动安装插件并创建配置文件 ~/.config/yt-dlp/config，内容：",
        "--impersonate chrome",
        "--cookies-from-browser chrome",
        "",
        "yt-dlp 在 Windows 上按优先级查找配置文件：",
        "1. 便携式配置（exe 旁边的 yt-dlp.conf）",
        "2. ~/.config/yt-dlp/config ← 本清单使用此位置",
        "3. ~/yt-dlp.conf ← 将忽略此配置",
        "4. %APPDATA%/yt-dlp/config ← 将忽略此配置",
        "",
        "由于本清单使用优先级 #2，后续的配置文件（#3、#4）将不会被读取。",
        "如果安装时检测到已存在的配置文件，会显示警告提示，请检查并合并配置。",
        "",
        "更多信息：",
        "插件安装位置：~\\.config\\yt-dlp\\plugins\\yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock",
        "插件项目地址：https://github.com/seproDev/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock"
    ],
    "checkver": "v([\\d.]+)",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/seproDev/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock/releases/download/v$version/yt-dlp-ChromeCookieUnlock.zip"
    }
}
